<title>SPAIN: MOTORCYCLING-PUIG LEADS HOME CHARGE IN SPANISH GP QUALIFIERS.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-PUIG LEADS HOME CHARGE IN SPANISH GP QUALIFIERS.</headline>
